hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18495","Waki narrated to us, from Bashir ibn Salman, from al-Qasim ibn Safwan, from his father, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) who said: Cool the noon prayer, for intense heat is from the fierceness of Hell."
"18496","Yala ibn Ubayd narrated to us, Abu Ismail, meaning Bashir, narrated to us, from al-Qasim ibn Safwan al-Zuhri, from his father who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Cool the noon prayer, for heat is from the blaze of Hell."
